feat: DbChat v12.1 with auth, dashboard, viz-service, and v13 implementation plan

Core features (v10-v12.1):
- JWT auth with signup/login, role-based DB permissions
- Admin panel with user management and DB permission controls
- Natural language SQL via Qwen3-Coder-Next (reasoning mode)
- Vector-assisted table selection (Qdrant + nomic-embed-text)
- Smart SQL validation, repair loop (2 retries), answer formatting
- Persistent per-user chat history with load/clear
- Activity logging with user-scoped audit trail
- Dashboard with pin data, explore data in modal
- Viz-service for chart chip suggestions (bar, line, pie, scatter)
- Frontend SPA with dark theme, collapsible SQL/JSON, chart modals

New in this commit:
- IMPLEMENTATION_PLAN.md for v13: Query Explanation Mode + Multi-Turn Conversations
- Test scripts for LLM SQL generation (few-shot, Qwen3 benchmarks)
- Various utility and migration scripts
